:"notes.saas.product-vs-service"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.literature.escaping-the-build-trap","id":"zettel.literature.escaping-the-build-trap","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":166,"column":3,"offset":8500},"end":{"line":166,"column":34,"offset":8531},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.moc.product-thinking"}],"anchors":{"tentang-topik-ini":{"type":"header","text":"Tentang Topik Ini","value":"tentang-topik-ini","line":14,"column":0,"depth":2},"entry-point--mulai-dari-sini":{"type":"header","text":"Entry Point — Mulai dari Sini","value":"entry-point--mulai-dari-sini","line":18,"column":0,"depth":2},"klaster-gagasan":{"type":"header","text":"Klaster Gagasan","value":"klaster-gagasan","line":28,"column":0,"depth":2},"build-trap-dan-outcome":{"type":"header","text":"Build Trap dan Outcome","value":"build-trap-dan-outcome","line":30,"column":0,"depth":3},"product-project-service":{"type":"header","text":"Product, Project, Service","value":"product-project-service","line":35,"column":0,"depth":3},"strategy-dan-gap":{"type":"header","text":"Strategy dan Gap","value":"strategy-dan-gap","line":40,"column":0,"depth":3},"process-dan-discovery":{"type":"header","text":"Process dan Discovery","value":"process-dan-discovery","line":45,"column":0,"depth":3},"organisasi-dan-insentif":{"type":"header","text":"Organisasi dan Insentif","value":"organisasi-dan-insentif","line":50,"column":0,"depth":3},"sumber-utama":{"type":"header","text":"Sumber Utama","value":"sumber-utama","line":56,"column":0,"depth":2},"pertanyaan-terbuka":{"type":"header","text":"Pertanyaan Terbuka","value":"pertanyaan-terbuka","line":63,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"6ie1ckeu7jfftzq54vt9e44","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"moc-product-thinking\">MOC: Product Thinking<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#moc-product-thinking\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"tentang-topik-ini\">Tentang Topik Ini<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tentang-topik-ini\"></a></h2>\n<p>Product thinking adalah cara memaknai produk bukan sebagai daftar fitur, tapi sebagai sistem yang menghubungkan masalah customer, nilai bisnis, dan pengalaman end-to-end. MOC ini mengumpulkan gagasan dari build trap, product-led organization, discovery, strategy, dan service sense.</p>\n<h2 id=\"entry-point--mulai-dari-sini\">Entry Point — Mulai dari Sini<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#entry-point--mulai-dari-sini\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.escaping-the-build-trap\">Escaping the Build Trap</a> — literatur utama tentang build trap dan product-led organization</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.escaping-the-build-trap\">Escaping the Build Trap</a> — ringkasan bacaan dengan struktur diagnosis → role → strategy → process → organization</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/handbook.product-thinking.from-feature-to-service-design\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled class=\"task-before task-status\"><span class=\"task-status-text\">(published)</span>Learning Path: Dari Feature Checklist ke Service Design Thinking</a> — learning path untuk keluar dari feature checklist dan mulai dari pain point kecil</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/handbook.product-thinking.service-sense-and-journey-thinking\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled class=\"task-before task-status\"><span class=\"task-status-text\">(published)</span>Service Sense dan Journey Thinking: Dari Fitur Tempel ke Pengalaman yang Mengalir</a> — framework service sense untuk membuat produk mengalir</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.saas.product-vs-service\">Product vs Service dalam SaaS</a> — contoh perbedaan product vs service dalam konteks SaaS</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"klaster-gagasan\">Klaster Gagasan<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#klaster-gagasan\"></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"build-trap-dan-outcome\">Build Trap dan Outcome<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#build-trap-dan-outcome\"></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.escaping-the-build-trap\">Escaping the Build Trap</a> — build trap adalah organisasi yang mengukur kemajuan dari fitur selesai, bukan outcome.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.escaping-the-build-trap\">Escaping the Build Trap</a> — ringkasan konsep output vs outcome, value exchange, dan product-led thinking.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"product-project-service\">Product, Project, Service<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#product-project-service\"></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.saas.product-vs-service\">Product vs Service dalam SaaS</a> — membedakan product dan service di SaaS.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/handbook.product-thinking.from-feature-to-service-design\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled class=\"task-before task-status\"><span class=\"task-status-text\">(published)</span>Learning Path: Dari Feature Checklist ke Service Design Thinking</a> — urutan belajar yang menjembatani product vs service dengan discovery dan service design.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"strategy-dan-gap\">Strategy dan Gap<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#strategy-dan-gap\"></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.escaping-the-build-trap\">Escaping the Build Trap</a> — strategy sebagai sistem keputusan untuk menghubungkan visi dengan eksekusi.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/handbook.product-thinking.from-feature-to-service-design\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled class=\"task-before task-status\"><span class=\"task-status-text\">(published)</span>Learning Path: Dari Feature Checklist ke Service Design Thinking</a> — pendekatan untuk menjadikan product thinking sebagai operating model.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"process-dan-discovery\">Process dan Discovery<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#process-dan-discovery\"></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/handbook.product-thinking.from-feature-to-service-design\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled class=\"task-before task-status\"><span class=\"task-status-text\">(published)</span>Learning Path: Dari Feature Checklist ke Service Design Thinking</a> — fokus pada opportunity, bukan sekadar fitur.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/handbook.product-thinking.service-sense-and-journey-thinking\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled class=\"task-before task-status\"><span class=\"task-status-text\">(published)</span>Service Sense dan Journey Thinking: Dari Fitur Tempel ke Pengalaman yang Mengalir</a> — service sense sebagai perasaan momen berikutnya dalam pengalaman pengguna.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"organisasi-dan-insentif\">Organisasi dan Insentif<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#organisasi-dan-insentif\"></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.escaping-the-build-trap\">Escaping the Build Trap</a> — produktivitas sejati datang dari outcome-focused rewards, budgeting discovery, dan safety.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"sumber-utama\">Sumber Utama<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#sumber-utama\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.escaping-the-build-trap\">Escaping the Build Trap</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/handbook.product-thinking.from-feature-to-service-design\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled class=\"task-before task-status\"><span class=\"task-status-text\">(published)</span>Learning Path: Dari Feature Checklist ke Service Design Thinking</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/handbook.product-thinking.service-sense-and-journey-thinking\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled class=\"task-before task-status\"><span class=\"task-status-text\">(published)</span>Service Sense dan Journey Thinking: Dari Fitur Tempel ke Pengalaman yang Mengalir</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.saas.product-vs-service\">Product vs Service dalam SaaS</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"pertanyaan-terbuka\">Pertanyaan Terbuka<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#pertanyaan-terbuka\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bagaimana perusahaan terbaik mengukur outcome tanpa kehilangan momentum delivery?</li>\n<li>Seberapa jauh perbedaan antara product thinking dan service thinking dalam SaaS B2B?</li>\n<li>Apa struktur feedback organisasi yang paling cepat mendeteksi ketika product thinking berubah kembali menjadi feature factory?</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #f8481c;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.structure-note\">structure-note</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #edc8ff;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.moc\">moc</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">product-thinking (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.escaping-the-build-trap\">Escaping the Build Trap</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked